From: Kevin Liu <11365056+kliu128@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 19:00:00 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] wifi: ath11k: wait five seconds for vdev setup

ath10k and ath12k wait 5 s for a vdev start or stop response, ath11k 1 s.
On the Deco XE5300 the 5 GHz QCN6122 sometimes fails its first start after
boot with a vdev setup timeout (-110) and works when started again. The
timeout is the suspected cause; this has not been confirmed on hardware.

---
--- a/drivers/net/wireless/ath/ath11k/wmi.h
+++ b/drivers/net/wireless/ath/ath11k/wmi.h
@@ -2692,7 +2692,7 @@
 	u32 ssid[8];
 } __packed;
 
-#define ATH11K_VDEV_SETUP_TIMEOUT_HZ (1 * HZ)
+#define ATH11K_VDEV_SETUP_TIMEOUT_HZ (5 * HZ)
 
 struct wmi_vdev_start_request_cmd {
 	u32 tlv_header;
